Agents
An agent is a small program that is installed on a host in order for Checkmk to be able query data from the host.

Checkmk can configure its agents individually, create (or bake) them in this configuration as a package, sign them and update them automatically. Agents can also update themselves once they have registered with the server.

You can find an introduction to agents in the Checkmk guide and more information about the Agent Bakery of checkmk enterprise in Automatic agent updates.

