Host tag groups
Host tag groups are, besides the static folder structure, another more flexible way to organize hosts in Checkmk for configuration. A host tag group is a collection of different host tags, with each host receiving exactly one tag from the group.

You can find an introduction to hosts including host tags and host tag groups in the Checkmk guide.

